#
# WiamOX kernel 7.3 - driver set for recent PCs and laptops (~2018 and newer)
# Created by Wiam Khader for WiamOX
#
# Derived from the 7.2 driver set (../linux/wiamox-drivers.config) with the
# legacy / non-PC / ARM-board drivers removed: old HDA codecs, Toshiba/Fujitsu/Sony/Panasonic/... laptop drivers,
# industrial-PC and Atom-tablet drivers, boutique HID devices, Type-C
# controller chips that only ship on ARM boards.
# Wi-Fi is NOT trimmed: every family is built (see also wiamox-base.config).
# Anything dropped here is also forced off in wiamox-base.config where the
# x86_64_defconfig could turn it on again.
#
